  "notes": [
    "The original fused CE, same-satellite CE, auxiliary branch CE and view KL are unchanged. One mean 8-way supervised prototype CE with coefficient 0.5 is added.",
    "For each anchor, its own prototype excludes the anchor. Labelled 8x4 minibatches use equal weight per within-batch class. Five original synchronized features and the full-rate feature each receive prototype supervision.",
